description	"Jod Na Nawood

A Force-sensitive scoundrel who relies on heavy blaster fire, instant smoke escapes, and pragmatic Force utility.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
- Jury Rigged Blaster Cannon (3)
-- Blaster Pistol
-- 4 Shots, 20% Slower RoF
-- 40%+ Damage/FP Drain
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Blue Style)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)
-- Blaster Defense (1)
-- Tracks On Hit
- Smoke Grenades (4)
-- Frag Grenade, 0 Damage, Smoke Screen Effect

^5Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (2)
- Mind Trick (2)

^8Attributes:
- 15% Faster Hack Speed
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (1)
- Tracking Beacon
- Dexterity (1)
- Blast Armor
- Anti MT (1)

^8Abilities:
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS2]
- Disguise (1) ^3[Style Swap In Melee]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Dash (2) ^3[CS3]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS4]"